<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Netcom.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Netcom.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Securities analyst Marc Roberts said he raised his rating on Netcom On-Line Communication Services to a buy from a hold based on valuation.</p>
<p>He believes the cash flow potential of the company will be about $24 million at the end of 1996, or $2.09 per share. His 12-month target price range is $30 to $40 per share, or about 88 percent above current levels.</p>
</text>
